# The bundled offline engine is a BUILD ARTIFACT copied from agent/denpex_canonical.mjs
# by scripts/bundle-engine.js during `npm run compile`. It is ~7 MB and byte-identical to
# its source, so committing it would store the same bytes twice and guarantee the two
# drift apart. It ships in the .vsix (see .vscodeignore, which deliberately does NOT
# ignore it) and is regenerated on every build.
#
# worker/__tests__/vscode-offline-engine.test.ts skips when it is absent and FAILS when it
# is present but stale, which is the property that actually matters.
engine/

# Packaged extensions - build outputs, and previously they were being packaged into each
# other because there was no .vscodeignore.
*.vsix
